  "title": "India's 'Cockroach' Protests in Delhi Amid Judicial and Political Controversies",
  "summary": "Thousands of protesters in Delhi have gathered at the PM's residence, calling for justice and opposing political misuse of privileges, while the government contested the protests and highlighted judicial oversight. The Supreme Court dismissed a plea against a public figure’s renovation, and protesters continue to demand accountability.",
